[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0136","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0663","title":"Apple QuickTime TeXML文件处理栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本在 Windows 平台上处理 TeXML 文件时存在多个基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的 TeXML 文件，当用户使用 QuickTime 打开该恶意文件时，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够在受影响系统上执行任意代码或造成应用程序崩溃。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度中等，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，进一步降低了利用门槛。Apple 已发布 QuickTime 7.7.2 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0663"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-16T10:12:56Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 TeXML 文件处理中的多个栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 Apple 已停止对 Windows 版 QuickTime 的支持，建议在无法升级的环境中彻底卸载 QuickTime，或禁用浏览器中的 QuickTime 插件，同时避免打开来源不明的 TeXML 及多媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53571","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027065","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19433","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0663","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0663.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0663.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/cc31a434e24cc02a2538d6715dca3a7fe963ede8/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0663.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0663.json","https://github.com/vulsio/msfdb-list/blob/67cb0d7ff40142f6c36b75c56b115eff98388b66/rapid7/2012/CVE-2012-0663.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0663.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0663.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0029","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0265","title":"Apple QuickTime 文件路径栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本在 Windows 平台上存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户通过 QuickTime 打开包含特制文件路径的多媒体文件时，程序在处理文件路径名时未正确验证输入长度，导致栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，诱使用户访问恶意构造的文件或链接，触发缓冲区溢出，从而实现任意代码执行或导致应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响所有 Windows 平台上的 QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Apple 已发布 QuickTime 7.7.2 版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0265"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-16T10:12:56Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.7.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件路径处理中的栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。用户可通过 Apple 官方支持页面（http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261）获取更新。由于 Apple 已停止对 Windows 版 QuickTime 的安全支持，建议卸载 QuickTime for Windows 并改用 VLC 等替代播放器；如无法卸载，应在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件并阻止其处理来自不可信来源的媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53578","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027065","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16170","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0265","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0265.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2012/CVE-2012-0265.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-02xx/CVE-2012-0265.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0011","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1823","title":"PHP PHP-CGI 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 的 CGI 模式（php-cgi）中存在参数注入漏洞，当 PHP 以 CGI 脚本方式运行时，sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c 未能正确处理不含等号（=）的查询字符串，导致远程攻击者可通过在查询字符串中注入命令行选项（如 -d、-s 等）来执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 PHP 5.3.12 之前版本及 5.4.2 之前版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过构造类似 /cgi.php?-d+allow_url_include%3don+-d+auto_prepend_file%3dphp://input 的请求实现远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1823"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-11T10:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 PHP 至 5.3.12 或 5.4.2 及以上版本。如无法升级，将运行模式从 CGI 切换为 FastCGI 或 mod_php，或在 Web 服务器层添加 RewriteRule 过滤不含等号的查询字符串：RewriteCond %{QUERY_STRING} ^[^=]*$ [NC]；RewriteRule ^.*$ - [F,L]。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://eindbazen.net/2012/05/php-cgi-advisory-cve-2012-1823/","http://h20000.www2.hp.com/bizsupport/TechSupport/Document.jsp?objectID=c03360041","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00002.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00011.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134012830914727&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0546.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0547.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0568.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0569.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0570.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49014","http://secunia.com/advisories/49065","http://secunia.com/advisories/49085","http://secunia.com/advisories/49087","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5501","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2465","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/520827","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/673343","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:068","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/06/07/1","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php#5.4.2","http://www.php.net/archive/2012.php#id2012-05-03-1","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027022","https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=61910","https://bugs.php.net/patch-display.php?bug_id=61910&patch=cgi.diff&revision=1335984315&display=1","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/PKGTQUOA2NTZ3RXN22CSAUJPIRUYRB4B/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/W45DBOH56NQDRTOM2DN2LNA2FZIMC3PK/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/PKGTQUOA2NTZ3RXN22CSAUJPIRUYRB4B/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1823","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1823.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1823.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2012/CVE-2012-1823.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/php/CVE-2012-1823.md","https://github.com/j0bin/Pentest-Resources/blob/94995990abed3dbce8f4bb29e11127265515aa9a/Attack/cve-2012-1823.py","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-1823.js","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-2336.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2021/CVE-2021-2291.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-2311.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2013/CVE-2013-4878.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1823.md","https://github.com/0xl0k1/CVE-2012-1823","https://github.com/Unix13/metasploitable2","https://github.com/tardummy01/oscp_scripts-1","https://github.com/drone789/CVE-2012-1823","https://github.com/cyberharsh/PHP_CVE-2012-1823"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0135","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0661","title":"Apple Mac OS X QuickTime 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 10.7.x 之前版本的 QuickTime 在处理 JPEG2000 编码的电影文件时存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的恶意 JPEG2000 编码影片文件，当用户使用 QuickTime 打开该文件时，触发已释放内存的引用，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。攻击需诱导用户访问恶意文件，无需身份认证，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0661"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-11T03:49:59Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:01Z","remediation":"升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本（随 Mac OS X 10.7.4 更新一同发布），可通过 Apple 软件更新或从 Apple 官网下载安装。如无法立即升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 JPEG2000 编码影片文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53445","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53466","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0661","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/80a58667e7dc9efd6d76b74cf4de29bd42310fd5/2012/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0661.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0661.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0661.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0135.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0134","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0660","title":"Apple Mac OS X QuickTime MPEG文件整数下溢漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 10.7.4 之前版本的 QuickTime 在处理特制 MPEG 文件中的音频流时存在整数下溢漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送恶意构造的 MPEG 文件，诱导用户在 QuickTime 中打开后触发缓冲区下溢，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。攻击需要用户交互，但无需身份认证，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0660"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-11T03:49:59Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:01Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.7.2 或更高版本（Windows 平台），或安装 OS X Lion v10.7.4 更新及 Security Update 2012-002（Mac OS X 10.6.8 及 Lion 平台）。如无法立即升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，避免自动解析来自不可信来源的 MPEG 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53445","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53469","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0660","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0660.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0660.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2012/CVE-2012-0660.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0133","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0659","title":"Apple Mac OS X QuickTime MPEG处理整数溢出漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 的 QuickTime 组件在处理特制 MPEG 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞。由于对 MPEG 文件中的某些数据字段长度验证不足，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意 MPEG 文件触发整数溢出，导致堆内存破坏，最终实现远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本及 Mac OS X 10.7.4 之前系统，攻击者需诱使用户访问恶意网站或打开恶意媒体文件，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。Apple 已在 Mac OS X 10.7.4 更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0659"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-11T03:49:59Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:01Z","remediation":"升级到 Mac OS X 10.7.4 及以上版本，或升级 QuickTime 到 7.7.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，建议不要打开来源不明的 MPEG 文件，并禁用浏览器 QuickTime 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53445","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53467","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0659","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0659.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0659.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2012/CVE-2012-0659.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0132","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0658","title":"Apple Mac OS X QuickTime 音频采样表处理缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 10.7.4 之前版本的 QuickTime 在处理渐进式下载影片文件中的音频采样表时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意构造的影片文件，触发该漏洞导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.7.4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。用户需升级至 Mac OS X 10.7.4 或更新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0658"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-11T03:49:59Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:01Z","remediation":"升级 Mac OS X 至 10.7.4 或更高版本（通过软件更新或下载组合更新），该版本已包含修复后的 QuickTime。Windows 用户升级 QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，并避免打开来源不明的媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53445","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53465","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0658","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0658.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0658.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2012/CVE-2012-0658.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0191","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0191.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1703","title":"Oracle MySQL Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL 的 Server Optimizer 组件中存在未明漏洞，远程认证用户可通过向 MySQL 服务器发送特制的查询语句触发该漏洞，导致数据库服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MySQL 5.1.61 及更早版本、5.5.21 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有有效数据库账户，无需特殊权限即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。Oracle 已在 2012 年 4 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1703"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-03T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:08Z","remediation":"将 MySQL 升级至 5.1.62 或 5.5.22 及以上版本。具体操作为：从 Oracle 官网下载 MySQL 5.5.22 或 5.1.62 安装包，执行升级安装；或通过 My Oracle Support Note 1406574.1 获取 Critical Patch Update April 2012 补丁集。如无法立即升级，可在数据库层面限制非必要用户的连接权限，并监控 Server Optimizer 相关异常查询以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","refe