ption":"Oracle MySQL Server 5.5.21 及更早版本中的 Partition 组件存在未指定的安全漏洞。已认证的远程攻击者可通过向 MySQL 数据库服务器发送特制的分区操作请求，利用该漏洞触发拒绝服务条件，导致数据库服务异常终止或无法响应正常查询。该漏洞影响 MySQL 5.5 系列所有低于 5.5.22 的版本，攻击者需拥有数据库的有效登录凭据方可利用，CVSS 评分 4.0，危害等级中低。Oracle 已在 2012 年 4 月的关键补丁更新（CPU）中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 MySQL 5.5.22 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1697"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-03T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:07Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 5.5.22 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Partition 组件的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 MySQL 配置中限制受影响用户的 PARTITION 操作权限，或通过防火墙限制数据库服务的访问来源 IP 以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48890","http://secunia.com/advisories/49179","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2012-366314.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53064","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026934","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1697.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2012/CVE-2012-1697.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1697.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1697.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1697.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2012/CVE-2012-1697.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1697","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1697.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1697","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/d85e3a1792768837470e0c79fd15b0f8bd851146/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-1697.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0189","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0189.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1690","title":"Oracle MySQL Server Optimizer 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL Server 5.1.61及之前版本、5.5.21及之前版本中的Server Optimizer组件存在未指定的拒绝服务漏洞。已认证的远程攻击者可通过向MySQL服务器发送特制的查询请求，利用优化器在处理特定SQL语句时的缺陷，导致MySQL服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需特殊权限即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响服务可用性，不影响机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1690"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-03T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:06Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL Server 至 5.1.62 或 5.5.22 及以上版本。对于无法立即升级的环境，可通过限制数据库用户权限、仅授予必要操作权限来降低攻击面，同时在网络层面限制对 MySQL 端口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1462.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48890","http://secunia.com/advisories/49179","http://secunia.com/advisories/51309","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2012-366314.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53074","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026934","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1690.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1703.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1690.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1690.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1690.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1690","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1690","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/d85e3a1792768837470e0c79fd15b0f8bd851146/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-1690.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1690.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1690.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0189.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0187","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1688","title":"Oracle MySQL Server DML 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Oracle MySQL 5.1.61及之前版本、5.5.21及之前版本的Server DML组件中存在未明漏洞。远程认证用户可通过发送特制的DML语句触发该漏洞，导致MySQL服务进程崩溃或拒绝服务。攻击者需拥有数据库的有效登录凭据，利用复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可实施攻击。该漏洞影响范围广泛，涉及所有使用受影响版本的MySQL数据库实例。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1688"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-03T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:05Z","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 5.5.22 及以上版本（或 5.1.62 及以上版本），该漏洞已在 MySQL 5.5.22 中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 my.cnf 中限制 DML 操作用户的连接数并启用查询超时参数（max_execution_time）以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1462.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48890","http://secunia.com/advisories/49179","http://secunia.com/advisories/51309","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2012-366314.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53067","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026934","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2012/CVE-2012-1688.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2012/CVE-2012-1688.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1688.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1688.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-1688.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1688","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1688.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1688","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/d85e3a1792768837470e0c79fd15b0f8bd851146/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-1688.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1688.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0106","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1710","title":"Oracle Fusion Middleware WebCenter Forms Recognition 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 10.1.3.5 中的 Oracle WebCenter Forms Recognition 组件存在未指定安全漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络利用未知向量攻击该组件，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互，影响范围广泛。Oracle 已在 2012 年关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1710"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-05-03T22:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:08Z","remediation":"立即登录 My Oracle Support 下载并安装 Oracle Fusion Middleware 10.1.3.5 的 April 2012 Critical Patch Update（CPUApr2012，参考 My Oracle Support Note 1406574.1）。如无法立即打补丁，建议在 Web 应用防火墙或网络层面限制对 WebCenter Forms Recognition Designer 组件的 HTTP 访问，仅允许受信 IP 来源访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2012-366314.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026949","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1710","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1710.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1710.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1710","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1710.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1710.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-1710/poc.py","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1710.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-1710.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-ch5p-j98f-3rg5/GHSA-ch5p-j98f-3rg5.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0186","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0186.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1521","title":"Google Chrome XML解析器释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 18.0.1025.168 之前版本的 XML 解析器中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制的 XML 内容，诱使用户通过 Chrome 浏览器访问恶意页面，触发已释放内存的访问，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，或可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有 Chrome 18.0.1025.168 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。Google 已在 Chrome 18.0.1025.168 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1521"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-05-01T10:12:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:40Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 18.0.1025.168 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 内置更新程序自动检查更新。对于 Apple iOS 设备，升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本，通过设置→通用→软件更新完成升级。如无法立即更新，可禁用 JavaScript 解析作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=117110","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/04/stable-channel-update_30.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/81644","http://secunia.com/advisories/48992","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201205-01.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53309","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027001","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75270","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15397","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1521.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1521","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1521","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1521.json","ht