_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0183.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0181","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1143","title":"FreeType 字体解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeType 字型渲染引擎在 2.4.9 之前版本中存在除零错误漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理特制字型文件时未对相关数值进行有效校验，导致除法运算中出现除数为零的情况，进而引发程序崩溃。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过向目标系统提交包含恶意构造字型数据的文件或网页链接，触发除零异常，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FreeType 2.4.9 之前版本，以及使用该库的 Mozilla Firefox Mobile 10.0.4 之前版本、Apple iOS 6.0 之前版本等产品。攻击者需要诱使用户打开特制字型文件或访问恶意网页方可利用，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1143"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:18Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:07Z","remediation":"将 FreeType 升级至 2.4.9 及以上版本（官方于 2012-03-08 发布修复版本）。Mozilla Firefox Mobile 用户应升级至 10.0.4 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议禁用不受信任字体的解析功能，或通过 Web 应用防火墙过滤包含畸形字体文件的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00002.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00015.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0467.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48508","http://secunia.com/advisories/48758","http://secunia.com/advisories/48797","http://secunia.com/advisories/48822","http://secunia.com/advisories/48918","http://secunia.com/advisories/48951","http://secunia.com/advisories/48973","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-04.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:057","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-21.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/03/06/16","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52318","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026765","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-140